					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1186646#post-2350461</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1186646/operation-camp-granada#post-2350461</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2015 15:27:48 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Machintruck</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1551475</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I am in no way a good lyric writer but here is my take on it:<br /> (its supposed to be read from the POV of MTF beta-5's leader, kinda like the first email)</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Lyrics!</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;hide&nbsp;dem</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>Hey Dr. Clef, Hey Sophia,<br /> Here we are at Camp Grenada<br /> We've been sent for a securing<br /> Some oh-oh-eights have been spotted they need clearing.<br /> Squads 1 and 2 are at the border<br /> Setting up a perimeter<br /> Number 3 got mighty lucky<br /> They’re distributing equipment from the buggy<br /> 4 and 5 are out there searching<br /> They are the ones exterminating<br /> Operation command is set<br /> One-oh-five and Adams haven’t been in use yet.<br /> Now I don't want this should scare ya<br /> 5’s counting two hundred fella’s<br /> They’re on their own, we’re retreating<br /> Alpha-nine are kicking ass but we are failing.<br /> One oh five shoots like a beast. Adams is a motherfuckin storm<br /> Don’t leave us out in the forest where we’ll get torn apart by some freaks.<br /> Support! M T F Nu seven, need your help, we hate Grenada<br /> 5 now says it was released on cue, we’ve got to find more clues…<br /> Dearest Alto, darling Dr. Light,<br /> How’d your precious experiment fight?<br /> Let me tell ya it was a success<br /> Even though the mission didn’t go for the best.<br /> So all in all, Alpha Niner<br /> Should be approved by 05 counselors<br /> Their next project? Gee that's better,<br /> They’re gonna take down a reality bender.</p> </div> </div> </div> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
